  (text "JFOX TMR carrier.\\nThree PX4FMUv2.4.5 modules stacked on M3 + Richco R908-5 (7.95mm) spacers,\\ncabled to this board through their existing DF13 connectors.\\nMounting pattern is 30.0 x 30.0 mm, taken from the module's own .brd file." (at 25.4 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5ffd139a-54cb-4e66-ac4a-18b7c90389b3)
  )
  (text "CAN1 BUS - daisy chain, NOT a star. Keep every stub short.\\nNO TERMINATION ON THIS BOARD. Each module carries R409, a fixed 120R\\nacross CAN_H/CAN_L with no disable jumper (RC0402FR-07120RL, verified\\nfrom the FMU netlist). Three unmodified modules = 3x120R in parallel\\n= ~40R, a real signal-integrity fault.\\nREQUIRED: desolder R409 on the electrically-middle module only.\\nVerify ~60R across CAN_H/CAN_L with the bus unpowered before trusting it." (at 25.4 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4fc08564-c3f4-4f1c-b265-8ee91c165456)
  )
